<title>USA: Chart Industries Inc Q4 profit rises.</title>
<headline>Chart Industries Inc Q4 profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>EASTLAKE, Ohio 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended December 31</p>
<p>					     1996	 1995   % Change</p>
<p> Sales				  $45,091    $31,018	45.4%</p>
<p> Gross profit			  13,924	9,034	54.1%</p>
<p> Net income			     4,459	2,578	73.0%</p>
<p> Net income per share		   .44	  .26	69.2%</p>
<p>				     Twelve Months Ended December 31</p>
<p>					     1996	 1995   % Change</p>
<p> Sales				  148,400    112,479	31.9%</p>
<p> Gross profit			  45,002     30,775	46.2%</p>
<p> Net income			    15,029	7,063     112.8%</p>
<p> Net income per share		  1.48	  .70     111.4%</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>((New York Newsdesk -- 212 859-1610))</p>
